## Model

For all work in `gesh-project`, use **Grok 4.5** via model id **grok-build** (alias **grok-4.5**).

Do not use `grok-composer-2.5-fast` for GESH financial analysis or code changes in this repo.

Product LLMs (Claude Sonnet/Haiku, Gemini) inside Python scripts are separate — this rule is for the IDE agent only.